<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Boise Cascade cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Boise Cascade cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Jensen Securities said it downgraded the rating on Boise Cascade Corp to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- said it appears that weak pricing may persist for its major product grades longer than previously expected.</p>
<p>-- shares finished at 29 on Monday.</p>
</text>
